                                    <div class="stg-row-info">
                                        <div class="stg-row-label"><i class="bi bi-exclamation-triangle-fill me-2" style="color:#ef4444;"></i>Low-Time Warning Flash</div>
                                        <div class="stg-row-desc">Flash the timer bar red when 10 seconds remain</div>
